[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737039111","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-2737039111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":2737039111,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jI-cH","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T15:18:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T15:18:53Z","body":"This feels like an ugly api, but doesn’t seem to be a blocker (required pull request) for a godot engine game project.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737039111/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737068281","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-2737068281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":2737068281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jJFj5","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T15:27:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T15:27:36Z","body":"It's a bit nasty because having it deprecated now may cause more confusion, due of the methods and notifications existing side-to-side with the originals.\r\n\r\nAlso **CanvasItem** has a similarly ambiguous naming scheme with its transform notification.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737068281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737104312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-2737104312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":2737104312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jJOW4","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T15:37:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T11:00:44Z","body":"Agreed, this does seem to be compat breaking for modules etc?\r\n\r\nWould have been better to have been done during that Godot 3 -> 4 phase when there were a lot of major renames.\r\n\r\nAlso, I'm not sure it's actually correct, especially for canvas items. Canvas items send their local transform to the server, not global.\r\n\r\nEDIT: Actually I checked this morning and although local xforms are sent (in `Node2D::set_transform()`), canvas item xforms _do_ seem to be propagated on the scene side, so I eat my words, I guess this notification could be said to be global.\r\n\r\nIt's still very debatable either way though I suspect. `NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED` is vague, but as I understand it, although it signifies a change in global xform, it may or may not also accompany a change in local xform.\r\n\r\nRelated:\r\nI often wonder why the `NOTIFICATION` system wasn't designed with at least a parameter, it would have been useful disambiguation in cases like this without having to e.g. send `NOTIFICATION_GLOBAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED` _and_ `NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737104312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737144417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-2737144417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":2737144417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jJYJh","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T15:47:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T15:47:47Z","body":"While the rename makes sense, there is another similar inconsistency: `set_transform()` and `set_global_transform()` methods. Should the former be renamed to `set_local_transform()`?\r\n\r\nIdeally the methods and notifications should be consistent, but _that_ would break compatibility, because the current name would have to change meaning.\r\n\r\n> Agreed, this does seem to be compat breaking for modules etc?\r\n\r\nYeah, it renames internal methods. Though the old names could be left as an alias, so module compatibility is preserved.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737144417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737170120","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-2737170120","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":2737170120,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jJebI","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T15:53:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T15:53:59Z","body":"As mentioned earlier because of compatibility we can not remove the alternative renames until godot 5 and adding both has difficult usability","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737170120/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737989654","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-2737989654","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":2737989654,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jMmgW","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T20:12:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T20:12:18Z","body":"As mentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3866, the word \"global\" is ambiguous.\r\nI would prefer \"canvas transform\" or \"viewport transform\" depending on its meaning.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737989654/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2738671285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-2738671285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":2738671285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jPM61","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T00:39:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T00:39:16Z","body":"@Sauermann The word global is consistent with 3D global transforms, referring to the world origin. I think \"canvas transform\" and \"viewport transform\" would be confusing, because this gives me the impression that it takes into account the Camera2D or scaling. But either way, this is established terminology in Godot with properties like `global_transform`.\r\n\r\n> This feels like an ugly api, but doesn’t seem to be a blocker (required pull request) for a godot engine game project.\r\n\r\nCorrect. It is not a blocker. It is a low priority enhancement.\r\n\r\n> Also CanvasItem has a similarly ambiguous naming scheme with its transform notification.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what you mean by that, this PR is already changing CanvasItem.\r\n\r\n> Agreed, this does seem to be compat breaking for modules etc?\r\n\r\nI've updated the PR to include the old methods so that existing modules will keep working.\r\n\r\n> i.e. Canvas item notification should be NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED\r\n\r\nCanvasItem already has `NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED` in master.\r\n\r\n> Should the former be renamed to set_local_transform()?\r\n\r\nMaybe. I think a term by itself (like \"transform\") makes sense to refer to local automatically, but \"local\" can help clarify.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2738671285/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3488612962","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-3488612962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":3488612962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7P8AJi","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T00:51:40Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T00:51:40Z","body":"I don't think the benefits of renaming \"global\" outweigh the disruption.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3488612962/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3493115773","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-3493115773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":3493115773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QNLd9","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T20:05:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T20:05:59Z","body":"> I don't think the benefits of renaming \"global\" outweigh the disruption.\r\n\r\nFully agreed. We can't break compatibility in a minor release without a very _very_ strong reason. \r\n\r\nThis is something that we can consider for Godot 5.0. But, given the comments above, it might not even be the correct naming. So its arguable whether this is even an improvement over the status quo. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3493115773/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3494149763","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104352#issuecomment-3494149763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104352","id":3494149763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QRH6D","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-06T00:04:15Z","updated_at":"2025-11-06T00:04:15Z","body":"@clayjohn This PR does not break compatibility.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3494149763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]